<div><span class="badge warn">warning</span></div>
<div class="props"><span>Rule: <code>resource-leak</code></span> &middot; <span>Category: Reliability</span> &middot; <span>Block: <code>b-002</code></span> &middot; <span>Subflow: <code>sf-1</code></span> &middot; <span>File: <code>Main.txt</code></span> &middot; <span>Line: 3</span></div>
